格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH 持仓盈亏悬浮卡片（同花顺投资账本）— 自动同步真实持仓数据，显示今日盈亏、上证指数和当日走势图，无需手动添加股票。","id":"gh:1334903875","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-ths-holdings","slug":"PM25000/dsh-ths-holdings","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH 持仓盈亏悬浮卡片（同花顺投资账本）— 自动同步真实持仓数据，显示今日盈亏、上证指数和当日走势图，无需手动添加股票。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"dsh-ths-holdings"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A **Tonghuashun holdings plugin** providing a floating **position P&L; card** and a **portfolio repo"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rt Skill** for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Desktop and Web. It automatically syncs your **real portfolio "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"data** from the Tonghuashun investment-ledger (同花顺投资账本) — no manual stock picking. Displays **今日盈亏**"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" (today's P&L;), **上证指数** (Shanghai Composite Index), and an intraday mini chart, all in the A-share"},{"id":"p4s5","text":" red-up/green-down convention."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Unlike watchlist tools, this plugin reads your **actual positions** and shows your **real profit & l"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"oss** — both as a percentage and as a yuan amount — updating every 20 seconds."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Version compatibility"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Plugin **0.3.2** targets the DSH **0.2 series** and has been tested with Desktop **0.2.0-rc.2**, wit"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"hout a compatibility exemption. For DSH 0.1, keep plugin **0.2.0**; this migration does not support "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ility exemption. For DSH 0.1, keep plugin **0.2.0**; this migration does not support the older host."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**0.3.2** lets you enable the card and portfolio report Skill independently, sharing sign-in and por"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"tfolio selection. All card settings remain available; with only the Skill enabled, configure sign-in"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" under **Settings → Tonghuashun holdings**. Fully quit and restart DSH after upgrading."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Desktop"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. Open DSH Desktop and select **Plugins** in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Add plugin** and enter `dsh-t"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"hs-holdings` in the package field.\n3. Confirm that you trust the plugin as prompted, then select **I"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"nstall**.\n4. When installation finishes, select **Enable now**. The floating card appears at the bot"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"tom-right corner. If a restart is requested, fully quit Desktop and reopen it."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Desktop does not currently update plugins automatically. To upgrade an installed version, uninstall "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"it from the Plugins page, then install the new version. See the official DSH installation guide."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Web"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Run in a terminal:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"After installation, **restart `dsh web`** and refresh the DSH page. The floating card appears at the"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" bottom-right corner."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Desktop and Web manage their plugins separately; use the installation method for the application you"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"op and Web manage their plugins separately; use the installation method for the application you run."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The plugin details page provides two independent component switches:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Portfolio report Skill**: holdings queries in ordinary chat and scheduled reports.\n- **Tonghuash"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"un holdings plugin (card component)**: the floating card with P&L; and index data."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Both share the saved sign-in and portfolio selection. Enable either or both. All existing **⚙ card s"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ettings remain available**. With only the Skill enabled, sign in and choose a portfolio under **Sett"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ings → Tonghuashun holdings → Sign-in and portfolio**."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Recommended — auto-acquire:**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. Open DSH Desktop or Web and click **⚙** on the card.\n2. Click **🖥 自动获取 Cookie（推荐）** — a system br"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"owser window opens (Edge / Chrome — the first installed one wins).\n3. Sign in to the Tonghuashun inv"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"estment ledger in that window (QR code / account).\n4. When the sign-in succeeds the window closes it"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"self, the Cookie is saved automatically, and the card refreshes with your portfolio.\n5. The plugin a"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"uto-discovers your portfolio — if you have several, pick one from the dropdown. Done."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Click **立即更新数据** in the expanded ⚙ settings to fetch P&L; and the index immediately using the saved "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"sign-in and selected portfolio. The button shows a loading state during the request; failures retain"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" previous successful values and their original update time."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Open **Settings → Tonghuashun holdings** in DSH to change the refresh interval (default: 20000 ms, o"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"r 20 seconds) and card visibility. Click **Save** to apply changes immediately and retain them after"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" restart. Hiding the card stops its automatic refresh without disabling the Skill. The **Tonghuashun"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" holdings plugin** card component switch controls whether the card feature is loaded; chat queries a"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"nd scheduled reports require the **Portfolio report Skill** component to be enabled."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Manual (backup):**"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"1. Open https://tzzb.10jqka.com.cn and log in.\n2. **Click the browser's top-right menu → More tools "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"→ Developer tools** (`…` in Edge, `⋮` in Chrome). F12 may have no effect on this page; open the tool"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"s through the browser menu.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Query holdings in chat"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Schedule reports"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"For example, say:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- **📊 Real-time position P&L;** — polls every 20 s (configurable) from your actual portfolio\n- **¥ /"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" % toggle** — show today's P&L; as a yuan amount, a percentage, or both\n- **📈 Intraday chart** — min"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"i polyline with a zero axis, red-up/green-down\n- **🇨🇳 Shanghai Composite Index** — displayed alongsi"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"de your P&L;\n- **🔄 Auto-discovery** — `fund_key` is discovered from the portfolio list; multi-accoun"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"t selection via dropdown\n- **🖥 Auto-acquire Cookie** — one click pops the Edge sign-in window; the c"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"ookie is saved automatically, no F12 needed\n- **✓ Validate on save** — the stored cookie is checked "},{"id":"p35s7","text":"against the ledger right after paste or auto-acquire\n- **↕ Draggable** — drag the title bar vertical"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"ly along the right edge (position persists in localStorage)\n- **⚙ In-place settings** — paste Cookie"},{"id":"p35s9","text":" and select portfolio from the card itself\n- **🔒 Credential-safe** — the Cookie never leaves the hos"},{"id":"p35s10","text":"ct portfolio from the card itself\n- **🔒 Credential-safe** — the Cookie never leaves the host process"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## FAQ / Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Symptom | Cause & fix |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Known Limitations"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- **Auto-acquire uses a system browser** — no Playwright installation is needed. Edge or Chrome must"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" be installed and the host must have a visible desktop session; otherwise use manual paste.\n- Report"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"s currently support ordinary CNY portfolios holding Shanghai/Shenzhen stocks and ETFs. Margin accoun"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"ts, short positions, B shares and other markets are outside the supported scope.\n- Enter login infor"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"mation only in plugin settings, not in chat or scheduled prompts."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
